@startuml
title Life Game — 변경 전 (원본 Holub 코드, 태그 v0-original)
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Swing UI" {
  class Life {
    {static} +main(arguments : String[])
  }
  class Universe <<Singleton>> {
    -outermostCell : Cell
    {static} -theInstance : Universe
    {static} -DEFAULT_GRID_SIZE : int = 8
    {static} -DEFAULT_CELL_SIZE : int = 8
    {static} +instance() : Universe
    -doLoad()
    -doStore()
    +paint(g : Graphics)
    -refreshNow()
  }
  class Clock <<Singleton>> {
    -clock : java.util.Timer
    -tick : TimerTask
    -publisher : Publisher
    {static} +instance() : Clock
    +startTicking(millisecondsBetweenTicks : int)
    +stop()
    +addClockListener(observer : Listener)
    +tick()
    -createMenus()
  }
  interface "Clock.Listener" as ClockListener {
    +tick()
  }
}

package "도구" {
  class MenuSite
  class Files
  class Publisher
  class ConditionVariable
}

package "보드 모델" {
  interface Cell {
    +figureNextState(north : Cell, south : Cell, east : Cell, west : Cell, northeast : Cell, northwest : Cell, southeast : Cell, southwest : Cell) : boolean
    +edge(row : int, column : int) : Cell
    +transition() : boolean
    +redraw(g : Graphics, here : Rectangle, drawAll : boolean)
    +userClicked(here : Point, surface : Rectangle)
    +isAlive() : boolean
    +widthInCells() : int
    +create() : Cell
    +isDisruptiveTo() : Direction
    +clear()
    +transfer(memento : Storable, upperLeftCorner : Point, doLoad : boolean) : boolean
    +createMemento() : Storable
  }
  interface "Cell.Memento" as Memento {
    +markAsAlive(location : Point)
    +isAlive(location : Point) : boolean
  }
  interface Storable {
    +load(in : InputStream)
    +flush(out : OutputStream)
  }
  class Neighborhood <<Composite>> {
    -grid : Cell[][]
    -gridSize : int
    -amActive : boolean
    -activeEdges : Direction
    {static} -readingPermitted : ConditionVariable
    {static} -nestingLevel : int
  }
  class "Neighborhood.NeighborhoodState" as NeighborhoodState
  class Resident {
    {static} -BORDER_COLOR : Color
    {static} -LIVE_COLOR : Color
    {static} -DEAD_COLOR : Color
    -amAlive : boolean
    -willBeAlive : boolean
  }
  class Direction
}

Life ..> Universe : instance()로 화면에 추가
Universe --> Cell : outermostCell
Universe ..> Neighborhood : 생성 (8x8 안에 8x8 고정)
Universe ..> Resident : 생성
Universe ..> Clock : 구독 / stop()
Universe ..> MenuSite : Grid 메뉴 등록
Universe ..> Files : 파일 선택
Universe ..> ClockListener : 익명 클래스로 구현
Clock --> Publisher : 리스너 관리
Clock ..> ClockListener : tick() 알림
Clock ..> MenuSite : Go 메뉴 등록

Neighborhood ..|> Cell
Resident ..|> Cell
Neighborhood *-- "1..*" Cell : grid
Neighborhood ..> ConditionVariable : 그리기·계산 동시 접근 제어
Neighborhood +-- NeighborhoodState
NeighborhoodState ..|> Memento
Memento --|> Storable
Cell ..> Direction : isDisruptiveTo()

note right of Universe
  한 클래스가 화면(JPanel), 마우스 입력,
  Grid 메뉴, 파일 Load/Store, Clock 구독,
  보드 생성, Singleton을 모두 맡음
end note

note bottom of Cell
  redraw(Graphics)·userClicked(Rectangle)로
  모델 인터페이스가 Swing 그리기·픽셀 좌표에 의존
end note

note bottom of Resident
  Conway 규칙(B3/S23)과
  셀 색상이 코드에 고정
end note

note right of Clock
  java.util.Timer 별도 스레드에서 tick() →
  Swing 화면 스레드와 동시에 보드 접근
  (Neighborhood의 ConditionVariable로 제어)
end note

@enduml
